#: ../../../converters.md:274
msgid "Built-in Converters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../converters.md:276
msgid ""
"xlwings offers several built-in converters that perform type conversion to "
"**dictionaries**, **NumPy arrays**, **Pandas Series** and **DataFrames**. "
"These build on top of the default converter, so in most cases the options "
"described above can be used in this context, too (unless they are "
"meaningless, for example the `ndim` in the case of a dictionary)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../converters.md:281
msgid ""
"It is also possible to write and register a custom converter for additional "
"types, see below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../converters.md:283
msgid ""
"The samples below can be used with both `xlwings.Range` objects and UDFs "
"even though only one version may be shown."
msgstr ""

