msgid ""
"Note: instead of `dict`, you can also use `OrderedDict` from `collections`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../converters.md:302
msgid "Tuple converter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../converters.md:304
msgid ""
"Get the values as (nested) tuples instead of (nested) lists. This can be "
"helpful in connection with caching, as tuples are immutable and hashable."
msgstr ""

